==== OEM easy installation ====

  - Go to "Advanced/System Tools/Firmware Update".
  - Click "Browse" and upload the OpenWrt ''...factory.bin''
  - Click the "Upgrade" button, and select "Yes" when prompted.

==== OEM installation using the TFTP method ====

See also ->  [[docs:guide-user:installation:generic.flashing.tftp]]

  - Setup a TFTP server with address 192.168.0.5
  - Copy the ''...initramfs-kernel.bin'' to TFTP server folder, rename as ''test.bin''
  - While starting U-boot press '4' key to stop autoboot
  - From u-boot command prompt run ''tftpboot'' followed by ''bootm''

