==== Switch Ports (for VLANs) ====

Ethernet switch eth0 has 5 switch ports (WAN and LAN 1-4). They all share the same MAC address.
^ Port             ^ Switch port   ^
| Internet (WAN)   | wan@eth0      |
| LAN 1            | lan1@eth0     |
| LAN 2            | lan2@eth0     |
| LAN 3            | lan3@eth0     |
| LAN 4            | lan4@eth0     |


